  "solution": "**Given: **(1.5a2 - 2.5b2)(1.5a2 + 2.5b2) + 6.25ab\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n**(A-B)(A+B)={(A²-B²)}**\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n=>** (1.5a****2 - 2.5b2)(1.5a2 + 2.5b2****)** + 6.25ab\n\n=> ((1.5a²)² - (2.5b²)² ) + 6.25ab\n\n=> 2.25a4 - 6.25b4 + 6.25ab\n\n**Thus, '2.25a4 - 6.25b4 + 6.25ab' is the correct answer.**",
